Package: cnma
Type: Package
Title: Comprehensive Network Meta-Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("CNMA Development Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "dev@example.com")
    )
Description: A comprehensive toolkit for conducting network meta-analysis with both
    frequentist and Bayesian approaches. Features include transportability analysis,
    GRADE quality weighting, risk of bias (RoB2) assessment, meta-regression, parallel
    processing support, and extensive diagnostic capabilities. Designed for researchers
    conducting systematic reviews and meta-analyses in healthcare and other fields.
